{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4iApb3Tnun98Pm6xw6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumbler turns. The bolt slides back with a heavy, metallic groan.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, scarred by the hands of countless seekers. My hinges protest with the voice of centuries.\n\nA thin line of light bleeds through my frame.\n\nI am unlocked.\n\nBut I have not yet opened.\n\nWhat do you do?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":97,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}